# Ark System — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Deployed verbatim from public/_redirects to dist/_redirects.

# ── Canonical host ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Workers redirects require relative URLs only — absolute host redirects are
# configured in the Cloudflare Dashboard (Rules → Redirects) instead.
# When you clone this system for a client, update the Dashboard rule.
#
# NOTE: These must agree with `site` in astro.config.mjs, `site.url` in
# src/data/config.ts, and PUBLIC_SITE_URL in .env — see docs/map.md §8.

# ── Trailing slash normalisation ────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Trailing slash normalisation ───────────────────────────────────────────
# build.format is 'directory' and trailingSlash is 'ignore', so dist holds
# /pricing/index.html. Pages serves /pricing directly; this only guards against
# hand-typed /pricing/ links.
/pricing/   /pricing    301
/portfolio/ /portfolio  301
/contact/   /contact    301